    "text": "引用表要按来源分开，不能共用一个片段号。\n同一篇里的两处依据，指向的是两份原文。",
    "locator": {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "paragraph_id": "p0001"
    }
  },
  "R2": {
    "item_id": "itm-44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
    "source_revision": 1,
    "segment_ids": [
      "s0001"
    ],
    "text": "同号片段分开绑定，依据才知道自己属于谁。",
    "locator": {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "paragraph_id": "p0001"
    }
  },
  "R3": {
    "item_id": "itm-44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
    "source_revision": 1,
    "segment_ids": [
      "s0002"
    ],
    "text": "另一份材料的原话，开头同样从一号片段排起。",
    "locator": {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "paragraph_id": "p0002"
    }
  }
}
